  "merger_description": "The Australian Competition and Consumer Commission (**ACCC**) is currently assessing Petalite Investment Pte. Ltd.\u2019s (**Petalite**) proposed acquisition of approximately 32% of the equity interests in Cinven Discovery Holdings Limited Partnership and its subsidiaries (**Cinven**) (the **Acquisition**).\n\nPetalite is an investment holding company and an affiliate of GIC Pte. Ltd. (**GIC**).\n\nCinven is a private equity firm. Cinven and management hold 100% of the Envu Group (**Envu**). In Australia, Envu is active in the development and supply of weed, disease and pest control products for non-agricultural applications, including turf and ornamentals, professional pest management, industrial vegetation management, forestry, mosquito management, and rangelands and pasture management.",
